The '''Jedi Temple communication center''',<ref name="HH">{{TCW|Holocron Heist}}</ref> also known as the '''Jedi Council war room''',<ref name="Kenobi's Shadow">{{StoryCite|story=Kenobi's Shadow|book=The Clone Wars: Stories of Light and Dark}}</ref> or as the '''Jedi Temple's communications hub''',<ref name="A Valiant Vow">''[[The High Republic: A Valiant Vow]]''</ref> was a sprawling complex of chambers located in the [[Imperial Palace|Jedi Temple]] on [[Coruscant]], designated for the transmission and receiving of communications from across [[the galaxy]].<ref name="AOTC">{{Film|III}}</ref>

